{"synopsis":"Bagi seniman bela diri, dia dikenal sebagai Sword Calamity atau Sword Monster, tapi bagi rakyat biasa, dia adalah pahlawan. Sekitar tiga puluh tahun yang lalu, Junghyun, monster terkuat dan paling ditakuti dalam sejarah Sekte Wudang, tiba-tiba menghilang tanpa jejak setelah Heavenly Demon meninggal.\n\nDan setelah beberapa waktu berlalu, Junghyun yang masih menjaga penampilan mudanya, muncul kembali di dunia bela diri, membawa seorang gadis kecil. Gadis ini adalah Sojin, cucu dari Heavenly Demon, satu-satunya saingan sejati serta teman Junghyun dalam hidupnya.\n\nJunghyun melakukan perjalanan ke Gunung Wudang dengan Sojin. “Akankah mereka berdua dapat sampai di tujuan dengan selamat?”","alternative_title":"The Sword God Shining Dragon, 검신광룡","author":"Sadoyeon, Duhaetnim","artist":"io (IV)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"c4b4dc42-8c87-4b93-af51-f116cd24b701","number":"39","chapter":"39","title":"","date":"2025-06-25","released":"2025-06-25"},{"chapter_id":"ec618d19-8c31-4374-89ed-f3757f3afba9","number":"38","chapter":"38","title":"","date":"2025-06-24","released":"2025-06-24"},{"chapter_id":"33a2afcb-c05a-483f-9828-5b1c9431b5e6","number":"37","chapter":"37","title":"","date":"2025-06-09","released":"2025-06-09"},{"chapter_id":"140c8461-1b4c-4ac8-9392-5bc33717476b","number":"36","chapter":"36","title":"","date":"2025-06-08","released":"2025-06-08"},{"chapter_id":"4308d62c-339e-4849-983b-f34f0bc7acb4","number":"35","chapter":"35","title":"","date":"2025-06-04","released":"2025-06-04"},{"chapter_id":"e6860fb5-faf5-4e11-8302-59242c5355be","number":"34","chapter":"34","title":"","date":"2025-05-26","released":"2025-05-26"},{"chapter_id":"11606ae7-4dcc-43b2-b81f-a2ece2716d1f","number":"33","chapter":"33","title":"","date":"2025-05-26","released":"2025-05-26"},{"chapter_id":"a1e4132c-0e16-4328-a010-7159b6392352","number":"32","chapter":"32","title":"","date":"2025-05-14","released":"2025-05-14"},{"chapter_id":"33c19f25-f2d4-4986-97c3-a0e9a8dc6183","number":"31","c